<details class="reader-settings"><summary aria-label="Ajustar lectura"><span aria-hidden="true">Aa</span><span class="reader-control-label">Lectura</span></summary><div class="reader-settings-panel"><p class="eyebrow">A TU MANERA</p><div class="reader-setting"><label for="reader-size">Tamaño del texto</label><select id="reader-size"><option value="18">Pequeño · 18</option><option value="20" selected>Mediano · 20</option><option value="22">Grande · 22</option><option value="24">Muy grande · 24</option></select></div><div class="reader-setting"><label for="reader-font">Tipo de letra</label><select id="reader-font"><option value="serif">Serif</option><option value="sans">Sin serif</option></select></div><div class="reader-setting"><label for="reader-theme">Fondo</label><select id="reader-theme"><option value="paper">Papel</option><option value="light">Claro</option><option value="dark">Oscuro</option></select></div><label class="reader-focus-choice"><input type="checkbox" id="reader-focus"/> Sin distracciones</label><p class="reader-privacy">Tus preferencias y tu punto de lectura se guardan en este navegador.</p><p class="reader-storage-notice" data-reader-storage role="status" hidden>Este navegador no permite guardar los ajustes o el progreso. Puedes seguir leyendo.</p><div class="reader-small-actions"><button type="button" data-copy-link>Copiar enlace</button><button type="button" data-print-reading>Imprimir</button><button type="button" data-reset-reading>Borrar progreso</button></div></div></details>
